(text "TUB 1 AC ENTRY / AUTO VOLTAGE SELECT (bom 17p) - on the prereg PCB.  Sense-before-select: the transformers are TAPPED 0/115/230 V primaries; K901 de-energized feeds the 230 V ends (TAP230 = safe wiring).  The 200k/36.5k divider on the 9 VAC aux reservoir VSEL_AUX hands the LM393 ~0.155 x V_SEL; the 1.24 V TLV431 threshold = ~8.0 V aux -> 115 V mains gives ~5.5 V aux on the 230 V tap (selects TAP115), 230 V gives ~11-12 V (stays TAP230).  Wide, race-free margin for a 120/240 V service spread." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.000 20.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "13aa545b-bf76-4537-88a7-22d2834f8e42"))
(text "SEQUENCE: mains on -> reservoirs charge through R900 -> ~1.65 s TLC555 arm delay -> Q812 releases the LM393 gate node SEL_GATE -> comparator samples -> if low-line, K901 energizes (TAP115) and D817 clamps the sense node so a post-select reservoir jump cannot chatter the state -> ARMS rises and Q813 energizes the K900 bypass relay across R900." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.000 27.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.20 1.20)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "671fe7fb-0e4b-4e0c-839d-582d8ca74396"))
(text "LAYOUT NOTES: all mains-domain parts live in a fenced AC zone at the board edge by the chassis DD12 power-entry module (inlet/fuse/switch/filter are chassis-side, QC-tab feed to J900); >=6 mm creepage/clearance primary-to-SELV and L-to-N, milled slot under K901 between the primary-contact poles; MOVs + CM choke tight to the board's mains input; PE bond to the chassis screw next to the module; NO analog or digital copper inside the AC zone; transformers in a row along the AC-zone boundary with primaries facing it; aux/select logic is SELV - keep it on the secondary side of the creepage boundary." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.000 33.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.20 1.20)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "590e7b0b-a384-441e-9d94-ddef36523013"))
(symbol (lib_id "Connector_Generic:Conn_01x03") (at 30.480 59.690 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board no) (dnp no) (uuid "4745ea6e-a1a0-43e5-af1d-e85e191613e0") (property "Reference" "J900" (at 33.480 58.390 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Value" "DD12-PEM" (at 33.480 60.990 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Footprint" "" (at 30.480 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 30.480 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "Schurter DD12 power-entry module: C14 inlet + 4 A standard filter (2x1.5 mH CM choke, 100 nF X2, 2x2.2 nF Y2, 1M bleed) + 2-pole fuseholder + 2-pole rocker switch, screw-on A portrait, 6.3 mm QC tabs - USER-LOCKED 2026-10-27 (needs 4301.1401 2-pole drawer + RC320 rear cover + 2x T2A fuse)" (at 30.480 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "DD12.4121.111" (at 30.480 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "1" (uuid "4c2645cd-ec76-464e-bc80-c22f2b4c031f")) (pin "2" (uuid "1cdc141b-754b-4f17-9219-0d55dd02feeb")) (pin "3" (uuid "37c2076e-ece9-437b-a43c-4ee9eb88fec8")) (instances (project "bfdac_analog" (path "/1f497322-6e5e-412f-8234-ba66143c84d1/6c315dfe-dc77-4d3a-9721-68e9810e1d5a" (reference "J900") (unit 1)))))
