(text "Mains wire entry J910: Phoenix MSTBV 2,5/3-GF-5,08 flanged header (bolt-through mount holes carry the mechanical load) + MSTB 2,5/3-STF-5,08 screw-clamp plug, wire entry up to 2.5 mm2 = 14 AWG, 12 A/250 V rated; PEM end = insulated FASTON-250 receptacle on the DD12 output tabs." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.000 68.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.20 1.20)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dc8f9e9a-dfbf-433e-aae3-d87bac72d3f8"))
