(text "PS900 = Mean Well LRS-200-12 (bom 17d): universal-input SMPS - J930 mains feed taps AC_L_IN/AC_N_IN/AC_PE UPSTREAM of L900/CX901, so the CM choke + X2 sit BETWEEN the SMPS and the transformer feed (EMI isolation, still MOV-protected; own inrush limiting, works on either line, no tap-select).  DC: J931 '+12V' = 3 x V12SOM -> J506 V12SOM bank (C2-C11/D2-D11/E2-E11); J932 '12V-' = 3 x GND -> J506 GND perimeter (36 A/pole header capacity vs ~15 A planning figure).  The mezzanine target is Conn1/J506 (west edge, closest to the SoM) - its 30-contact V12SOM bank + GND perimeter is already allocated; the tub-side mate is still to be drawn (docs/SEAF_PIN_ASSIGNMENTS.md)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 270.000 248.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.20 1.20)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9d7ba4c7-9651-4d11-b23f-f36efe06227d"))
(text "LAYOUT: the L900+X2 barrier only blocks the COPPER path - the J930 L/N harness carries SMPS conducted HF and must not run parallel to the J92x secondary bundles (capacitive/inductive pick-up would bypass the barrier onto SELV leads). Twist J930 L/N, route clear of secondaries, cross at 90 deg if unavoidable. Twist the J931(+)/J932(-) pair together for minimum loop area to the mezzanine exit; bond the LRS-200 cage to chassis and give it distance from the R-cores." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 270.000 256.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.20 1.20)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b5f1dff0-c95a-49f4-abec-b1b4eed3331c"))
(symbol (lib_id "bfdac:PSU_ACDC") (at 320.040 294.640 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board no) (dnp no) (uuid "3f35b9de-8d52-4a09-abfb-d787efd75637") (property "Reference" "PS901" (at 323.040 293.340 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Value" "PSU-3V3" (at 323.040 295.940 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Footprint" "" (at 320.040 294.640 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 320.040 294.640 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "Mean Well RS-25-3.3 enclosed AC/DC SMPS, 25 W / +3.3 V / 6 A, universal 88-264 VAC input (own inrush limiting), chassis-mount screw terminals in tub - dedicated brick for the ENTIRE AP island: +V pins = VAP_IO direct (no VAP5), -V pins = GND_AP return, ~2-5 A budget (XMOS + host SoM + radios + Ethernet); its I/O isolation floats the GND_AP domain (bom 23); USER-RULED 2026-11-01" (at 320.040 294.640 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "RS-25-3.3" (at 320.040 294.640 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "1" (uuid "792579a1-27c8-49ee-8122-98d537adcd23")) (pin "2" (uuid "581dc666-57ee-47eb-869b-9487fc2faa16")) (pin "3" (uuid "c645b2b8-4504-4dd8-a01f-22cdbf292230")) (pin "4" (uuid "3da4e93f-c117-4ba7-812d-bacd889a220f")) (pin "5" (uuid "7b5603f2-0721-4569-b61d-8cae3c500661")) (instances (project "bfdac_analog" (path "/1f497322-6e5e-412f-8234-ba66143c84d1/6c315dfe-dc77-4d3a-9721-68e9810e1d5a" (reference "PS901") (unit 1)))))
