(text "PS901 = Mean Well RS-25-3.3 (bom 23): dedicated 3.3 V / 6 A brick for the ENTIRE AP island (XMOS + host SoM + radios + Ethernet ~2-5 A vs 6 A rating).  J933 mains feed taps AC_L_IN/AC_N_IN/AC_PE upstream of L900/CX901, same treatment as J930 (own inrush limiting, universal 88-264 VAC input).  DC out: 2 x +3.3 V + 2 x -V screw terminals -> twisted harness -> J854 4-pos Phoenix in the AP section - ** POLARITY ** J854 pins 1-2 = +3.3 V (VAP_IO), pins 3-4 = -V return (GND_AP).  The brick's I/O isolation is what floats GND_AP - bond the cage to chassis, keep it clear of the R-cores." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 270.000 308.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.20 1.20)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1a64e6d9-c97f-4553-a089-40a6d13f4f78"))
